==Battleground==
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 21.67~23.33 seconds<sup>650f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 21.67~23.33 seconds<sup>650f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 21.67~23.33 seconds<sup>650f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Yuma Kuga & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**6 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

